[{"title":"次韵刘后村所赠延庆主僧圭复翁诗三首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"清到复翁方是清，不求名处莫逃名。\n南湖一片平铺水，中有拍天波浪声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20788,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵刘后村所赠延庆主僧圭复翁诗三首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"古往今来几过帆，天高地下一浮庵。\n与翁相见亦偶尔，一笑无言意自参。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20789,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵如岳惠茶","author":"陈著","text":"槐窗梦断凤团香，松涧分来雀嘴尝。\n句引清风发吟兴，与师意思一般长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20790,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵孙古岩立春","author":"陈著","text":"一声唤起便成春，向日庭台总可人。\n本与东风旧相识，一回相见一回新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20791,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵竹窗兄相招","author":"陈著","text":"酒徒元不是高阳，君以诗招语亦香。\n虽欲醉归重九日，恐贻亲怒愧王祥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20792,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴竹溪谢单景山载酒","author":"陈著","text":"杯盘移醉冠春园，酒散人归月在门。\n何日喜还供笑语，酌君村酒侑齑盆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20793,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵弟观送牡丹","author":"陈著","text":"极目风沙姚魏家，耳边忍听后庭花。\n谁能把酒樽前醉，添得临风感岁华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20794,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵张子华七夕","author":"陈著","text":"郎自牵牛女自梭，驾言一岁一相过。\n不应妄念忘机杼，如此风波亦渡河。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20795,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵张君寿来见二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"大学门庭不易登，参前新意逐时生。\n须教一敬存神舍，莫是多吟费管城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20796,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵张君寿来见二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"万错生于一动閒，老夫不是不知还。\n春风百里回头处，莫怪移文到北山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20797,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵汪英春九日酒边","author":"陈著","text":"有客相过风雨秋，唾飞珠玉胜珍羞。\n但知女似谢道蕴，不道吾为马少游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20798,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵邑宰徐何谦道中咏风雨中闻藕花香","author":"陈著","text":"眼空尘世粉红娇，看了濂溪兴自饶。\n风雨中閒曾著句，满身身到庆登桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20799,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵陈帅干喜雨二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"一雨何关百里雷，天心端为众心回。\n閒时试向龙君觅，未必滂沱应手来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20800,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵陈帅干喜雨二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"何事犹屯水与雷，夜看云汉叹昭回。\n五龙一日齐行雨，且莫嫌他欠早来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20801,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵如岳醵饮西峰寺分韵成诗十四首见寄 其一","author":"陈著","text":"人世浮浮风里尘，不须更问果何因。\n有时意思悠然处，流水青山便是亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20802,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵如岳醵饮西峰寺分韵成诗十四首见寄 其十一","author":"陈著","text":"小小杯盘共话情，兹行聊尔过浮生。\n瘦吟学士如工部，楷法书来近率更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20803,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵如岳醵饮西峰寺分韵成诗十四首见寄 其十","author":"陈著","text":"老佛眉閒屋漏愁，残廊脚下草光浮。\n谁能饥坐芦穿膝，莫问神通石点头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20804,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵如岳醵饮西峰寺分韵成诗十四首见寄 其十四","author":"陈著","text":"游了南山山外山，北山下住更幽閒。\n消磨永日何妨睡，受用清风不用还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20805,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵如岳醵饮西峰寺分韵成诗十四首见寄 其六","author":"陈著","text":"萧萧四壁住残生，不学神仙不学僧。\n有酒未能忘北海，种瓜且自学东陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20806,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵如岳醵饮西峰寺分韵成诗十四首见寄 其四","author":"陈著","text":"天街追逐边尘乱，更点听残钟鼓院。\n归舟便觉昔年非，高枕已忘前日倦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20807,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵奉慈寺主居简","author":"陈著","text":"纳交虽浅自知深，一见如抽病眼针。\n已约飞云狎来往，谁知峰顶有千寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20808,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵前人补试落归曹娥待潮","author":"陈著","text":"谒祠江上且归休，有命何须企碧流。\n好把一言寤明主，声名当不减千秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20809,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵前人城北春行","author":"陈著","text":"醉游不省路东西，可意花枝手自提。\n好景未知何处是，漫随蜂蝶过芳畦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20810,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵前人新晴三首 其三","author":"陈著","text":"院静春深冷麝煤，怕逢花委细苍苔。\n小桃却自红如锦，笑倚东风醉入腮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20811,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵前人新晴三首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"泥香风软燕忙时，宿雨微中起较迟。\n试捲珠帘问花事，画鞦韆外袅晴丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20812,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵前人新晴三首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"流莺恰恰报新晴，如醉春光畅踏青。\n金犊车前诗料足，不妨分付入骚情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20813,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵前人壁閒诗 其一","author":"陈著","text":"万宇腥埃风满山，只饶二十里云閒。\n要知人好境不好，最怕身闲心未闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20814,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵袁司理送行三首 其三","author":"陈著","text":"潇洒秋光山水窟，木犀香底细评诗。\n今朝携手明朝别，此会一生能几时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20815,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵袁司理送行三首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"阴六阳三天者定，重逢樽酒定何时。\n但须别后频相问，来往翔鸿各寄诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20816,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵袁司理送行三首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"别友相逢情最好，相逢还别若为情。\n看君腾踏飞黄去，记取清镫影里盟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20817,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵屠仰之咏火","author":"陈著","text":"孔孟光华不死生，楚秦灰炬漫纷更。\n莫将烧叶焙浮烬，要把盘根养宿明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20818,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵惟西堂巧山二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"一片灵心著古风，清吟披拂到衰翁。\n从教湖海相传去，知我曾来茅屋中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20819,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵惟西堂巧山二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"清风明月本无边，我亦寻盟到白莲。\n青玉轩前坐来久，淡中滋味自相贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20820,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵梅山弟醉吟七首 其七","author":"陈著","text":"人于忙处不知老，诗到醉时方是真。\n相对梅山几杯酒，不知身亦是今人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20821,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵梅山弟醉吟七首 其六","author":"陈著","text":"开眼门外世梦短，忘情樽前閒意长。\n邂逅当有赤松子，歌舞何用楚兰香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20822,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵梅山弟醉吟七首 其五","author":"陈著","text":"蚊翼只为黄昏忙，鹄心自与青天长。\n世人皆失我独得，春风浩浩诗书香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20823,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵梅山弟醉吟七首 其四","author":"陈著","text":"鱼眼死也依然张，鹤颈生来如此长。\n凡物不齐各有分，不须逐臭存吾香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20824,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵梅山弟醉吟七首 其三","author":"陈著","text":"隐处是角里先生，放游是司马子长。\n试问梅山老居士，判断两家谁最香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20825,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵梅山弟醉吟七首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"暗檐行吟梅影瘦，午窗坐睡檀丝长。\n不作上下四方梦，何妨参受三峰香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20826,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵梅山弟醉吟七首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"高明所志希贤圣，愚暗惟知事鬼神。\n老我激昂非矫物，本心标榜未输人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20827,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵梅山送牡丹二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"毒雾腥尘涴色香，无知蜂蝶自乾忙。\n醉时烦恼不须醉，三斗谁能向汝阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20828,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵梅山送牡丹二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"姚根魏拨两京贵，蜀本黟枝南度春。\n今日东风为谁好，花香不到独醒人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20829,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵雪窦寺主僧炳同招游山二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"飞下吟笺墨妙斑，空拳难对敌家攀。\n肯分半榻清风况，翻怪诗来挠聒閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20830,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵雪窦寺主僧炳同招游山二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"万叶逢秋又缬斑，珠林锦镜好追攀。\n人生行乐非容易，本是閒人也未閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20831,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵鹿苑寺一览阁主岳松涧送茶","author":"陈著","text":"鹿苑书来字字香，满奁雀舌饷新尝。\n有时独坐相思处，一鼎松风午韵长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20832,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵童志道春晚","author":"陈著","text":"隔窗啼鸟梦惊残，沈麝香销冷博山。\n只枕半敧閒猛省，又添一日在人閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20833,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵童尚质","author":"陈著","text":"落日孤烟水绕村，山家灯火已昏昏。\n幽人事业书窗底，自读离骚半掩门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20834,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答张子开教授","author":"陈著","text":"两翁相对五里近，一病同眠八月天。\n彼此医治须努力，要成欢醉菊花前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20835,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵椿长老惠莲花扇","author":"陈著","text":"莲花法界走舆台，两扇香风为我开。\n藜藿皮毛消不尽，若为回向我如来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20836,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵僧云岫见寄","author":"陈著","text":"忆昔宫花压帽檐，如今野褐替朝衫。\n邯郸梦觉身犹在，安得寒山喝破岩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20837,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵僧云岫寄东皋寺主智恭","author":"陈著","text":"闻说东皋绝点埃，笑飞铁锡把山开。\n何须一面方相识，曾见藕花诗句来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20838,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵戴帅初村园杂兴二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"新园本是无多地，几步低平几步高。\n已逝江湖分雁啄，且从溪谷到龟毛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20839,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵戴帅初村园杂兴二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"田不充耕漫垦山，焦劳新做鬓毛斑。\n牛歌方见平生戚，鱼釜何曾饿死丹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20840,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵戴帅初觅茶子二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"新诗著意不曾疏，苦觅茶栽胜索租。\n搜送坚霜千碧颗，难酬五十斛明珠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20841,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵戴帅初觅茶子二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"风流清苦自成家，要撷春香煮雪花。\n知味不随鸿渐唾，剡翁自种剡翁茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20842,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵戴帅初架阁剡居四首 其四","author":"陈著","text":"隔一青山能几里，频频聚首约方来。\n生涯冷淡浑如此，输与斑衣学老莱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20843,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵戴帅初架阁剡居四首 其三","author":"陈著","text":"见说三閒松下屋，更无长物累中心。\n难忘独有南风操，时到溪山一鼓琴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20844,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵戴帅初架阁剡居四首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"青春踏过洛阳尘，今却寻盟郑子真。\n天下方酣施夺事，村中自有逊耕民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20845,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵戴帅初架阁剡居四首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"书担随身又入山，危途步步转头看。\n近于潇上二三里，难似江西十八滩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20846,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西上罕岭","author":"陈著","text":"此去向南西，山高山复低。\n不逢清话客，已觉倦扶藜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20847,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈竹石亭","author":"陈著","text":"说道疏时元是密，偶于忙处得寻閒。\n宿愁复岭重山外，新趣清风明月閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20848,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈龄叟二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"老师神用笑谈中，不但能降大小空。\n自谓我心顽似铁，也随柳絮舞春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20849,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈龄叟二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"溪山五里眼花中，万变风光一总空。\n惟有老师无处语，依然只是旧家风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20850,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"应百里李天益来求作奉川十咏似之 其一 广莫轩","author":"陈著","text":"高山处处著虚轩，来此凭阑便欲仙。\n下视浮云隔黄雾，平迎行日上青天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20851,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"应百里李天益来求作奉川十咏似之 其六 凤花","author":"陈著","text":"谁把深红浅绿蟠，羽毛飞动倚风阑。\n时人不识来仪瑞，只向花前想像看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20852,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"应百里李天益来求作奉川十咏似之 其八 石夫人","author":"陈著","text":"千尺嶙峋直立形，流传神应挟风霆。\n石身本聚山川气，便是人心聚处灵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20853,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"应百里李天益来求作奉川十咏似之 其七 龙松","author":"陈著","text":"皮皴肉紧发苍然，伏雪眠风傲岁年。\n不见南阳龙卧者，本心元自直通天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20854,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"应百里李天益来求作奉川十咏似之 其二 庆登桥","author":"陈著","text":"一水流南抱县行，一桥在上压溪横。\n傍阑多少人观政，要与桥平水与清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20855,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"应百里李天益来求作奉川十咏似之 其四 岳林","author":"陈著","text":"传说当年契此翁，偶然来此笑春风。\n忽抛布袋归何处，地下天高一阁空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20856,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"应百里李天益来求作奉川十咏似之 其三 虚白观","author":"陈著","text":"庭中说法有龙听，龙去庭空水一汀。\n独有亭亭岁寒柏，不知人世自青青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20857,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"应百里李天益来求作奉川十咏似之 其五 雪窦","author":"陈著","text":"乳峰真可避人閒，上妙高台天可攀。\n未说旷怀便笑傲，堪从险处习閒关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20858,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"应百里李天益来求作奉川十咏似之 其十 耀碑潭","author":"陈著","text":"微风篆水自成碑，清月磨潭不受疵。\n万里此通归去路，扁舟堪载送行诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20859,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"弟观为众奉里神于丹山僧舍有五绝因趁韵 其五","author":"陈著","text":"迎神旧是醉哗场，榷禁方严酒有坊。\n幸免叫嚣成鬼市，不妨安稳服农忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20860,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"弟观为众奉里神于丹山僧舍有五绝因趁韵 其四","author":"陈著","text":"老我今年七十二，已无半念到穷通。\n北窗一枕羲皇上，日自流西水自东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20861,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"弟观为众奉里神于丹山僧舍有五绝因趁韵 其二","author":"陈著","text":"人众由来口铄金，漫从时好答人心。\n堪怜寒露冰壶玉，尘满冠巾汗满襟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20862,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"弟观为众奉里神于丹山僧舍有五绝因趁韵 其三","author":"陈著","text":"一卷新吟水石香，顿教尘浊变清凉。\n唤醒心下十年梦，拜舞薰风面舜廊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20863,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]